 u defense taskforce\, led by Kimio Tamura\, played by DRIVE MY CAR’s Hideto
 shi Nishijima. After a particularly challenging encounter\, a silver giant 
 descends from the sky to rescue the planet. Dubbed Ultraman\, this giant’s 
 identity and purpose are a mystery. SHIN ULTRAMAN is a delightful reimagini
 ng of one of Japan’s classic superheroes\, full of cosmic twists\, charisma
 tic villains\, and giant Kaiju.
