 ts.\n\n*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*\n\nAgenda:\nOPC Project Meeting on Desktop Equip
 ment Order Process:\no       -Exam Room Order (EPIC Cost)\n•       -PC and 
 GCX brackets\n•       -Epic Order Sheet\n\no       -How to Order (by depart
 ment\, by wing)?\n\no       -Confirm we are shipping (everything) to 1400 T
