  -Fields that should be in the “Master Spread Sheet”.\n•       Location  (F
 loor\, W/S/E\, Room #)\n•       Department\n•       Architectural Room Numb
 er\n•       Persons Name or Job Role\n•       Device type\n•       -Printer
