DESCRIPTION:Diasporic Vietnamese Artists Network (DVAN) is in the mood for 
 love. We will hold a fall FUNdraiser and Social Mixer @ Bissap Baobab (Miss
 ion SF) on Thursday\, September 25th\, 2014. \n\nYou're invited! Come mingl
 e with cool artists\, writers and members of the DVAN family. Learn about t
 he 2015 Vietnamese Film Festival\, upcoming events and programs and how you
  can be a catalyst for the Vietnamese arts community. \n\n 6:30 Happy Hour\
 n 7:30 "Love" readings and auction\n 10:00 Live Funk Music\n\nCome for drin
 ks\, stay for dinner. Bissap Baobab will donate 20% of drink and delicious 
 food purchases to DVAN. Come one\, come all\, bring friends\, flirt and fre
 estyle. This is going to be an epic!\n\nAdmission: \n$10 - $15 sliding scal
 e @ the door. Tickets are tax deductible and includes a free hug.\n\nDVAN i
 s a non-profit organization dedicated to promoting artists from the Vietnam
 ese Diaspora through cultural\, visual\, literary\, performing arts\, film 
 and publications that explore connections between art and society. We conne
 ct Vietnamese artists in the United States\, France\, Canada\, Australia\, 
 and Vietnamese communities overseas.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230201T081927Z
LOCATION:Bissap Baobab\, 3372 19th St.\, San Francisco
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:DVAN Fall Fling Mixer & Fundraiser
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
