 oft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_MGJmNDllZmQtMTM4NS00ZDYwLThlNTEtOTE0Y2Nj
 MTFlNDA0%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22845913d7-13aa-43d7-971e-a3
 f678da6784%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22c26ed250-4a65-4756-9cc3-e638de0ac6fc%22%7d>\
 nMeeting ID: 283 862 074 95\nPasscode: qt3Cyy\nDownload Teams<https://www.m
 icrosoft.com/en-us/microsoft-teams/download-app> | Join on the web<https://
 www.microsoft.com/microsoft-teams/join-a-meeting>\n[https://milestone.zoom.
 us/account/branding/p/2094e733-96b4-4cd0-bcee-55f16e1c5783.png]\n\n\nJob De
 scription Below:\nCompany Overview:\nMilestone Technologies is a global IT 
 managed services firm that partners with organizations to scale their techn
 ology\, infrastructure and services to drive specific business outcomes suc
 h as digital transformation\, innovation\, and operational agility. Milesto
 ne is focused on building an employee-first\, performance based culture and
  for over 25 years\, we have a demonstrated history of supporting category-
 defining enterprise clients that are growing ahead of the market. The compa
 ny specializes in providing solutions across Application Services and Consu
 lting\, Digital Product Engineering\, Digital Workplace Services\, Private 
 Cloud Services\, AI/Automation\, and ServiceNow. Milestone culture is built
  to provide a collaborative\, inclusive environment that supports employees
  and empowers them to reach their full potential.\n\nOur seasoned professio
 nals deliver services based on Milestone’s best practices and service deliv
 ery framework. By leveraging our vast knowledge base to execute initiatives
 \, we deliver both short-term and long-term value to our clients and apply 
 continuous service improvement to deliver transformational benefits to IT. 
 With Intelligent Automation\, Milestone helps businesses further accelerate
  their IT transformation. The result is a sharper focus on business objecti
 ves and a dramatic improvement in employee productivity. Through our key te
 chnology partnerships and our people-first approach\, Milestone continues t
 o deliver industry-leading innovation to our clients. With more than 3\,000
  employees serving over 200 companies worldwide\, we are following our miss
 ion of revolutionizing the way IT is deployed around the globe.\nDescriptio
 n:\nAs a Level 2 Desktop Support you are responsible for supporting client 
 technology and services located onsite at the customer location. This inclu
 des but not limited to desktop/laptop break/fix\, re-imaging\, troubleshoot
 ing\, desk & mobile phone support and Audio/Visual & physical conference ro
 om support technologies. This is an internal end user employee facing role 
 where your skills at maintaining and developing relationships with internal
  users and executive staff is crucial.\nHow You Will Make An Impact:\n\n  *
    Plan\, design\, implement\, and support hardware and software installati
 on projects\n  *   Analyze\, test\, and debug compute device systems\n  *  
  Customize systems for specific functional areas or unique user needs\n  * 
   Laptop/Desktop Break-Fix\, Remote Desktop Support\, Remote Office on-site
  Travel\n  *   Support OS\, variety of applications\, security agents/servi
 ces\, and hardware issues for users (MAC OS\, Windows\, IOS\, Android)\n  *
    Work with IT Infrastructure teams to setup and maintain existing infrast
 ructure environments and assist with local changes\n  *   Provide user trai
 ning and education\n  *   Re-imaging with data transfer a requirement\n  * 
   New HW delivery and setup. May require lifting of boxes and compute HW in
  addition to installation under desks\n  *   Printer installation and troub
 leshooting\n  *   Problem diagnosis and resolution\n  *   Ensure client sat
 isfaction and client management\n  *   Provide user training and education\
 n  *   Reporting to customers and management on status\, resource needs\, a
 nd projected outcomes\n  *   Mentorship and training of junior Regional IT 
 Specialists by more senior members of the team on processes and tools\n  * 
   Project management\nWhat You Will Need To Succeed:\n\n  *   Job experienc
 e and history focused on Desktop Support at Tier 2 levels\n  *   Proficient
  in macOS and Microsoft Windows.  Skilled in all diagnostics\, commands\, e
 tc.\n  *   Experienced in utilization of array of Desktop Imaging and MDM t
 ools\, such as Intune\, SmartImager\, Imperious\, SmartDeploy.\n  *   A tho
 rough knowledge of Personal Computer Hardware\, PDA devices\, Desktop Softw
 are\, Windows 10\, Office 365\, Microsoft Office products\, OSX\, G-Suite s
 upport & administration\, Anti-Virus\, Internet Browsers\, Internet connect
 ivity\n  *   Demonstrated proficiency and professionalism when interfacing 
 with customer employees\, executives\, and VIPs when providing Desktop Supp
 ort\n  *   Leadership ability to ensure technical growth and professionalis
 m of Desktop team and colleagues.\n  *   3+ years relevant technical experi
 ence supporting users in a Windows and Mac environment\n  *   Ability to mu
 lti-task and manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment\n  *   
 Ability to diagnose and solve complex technical issues\n  *   Ability to pr
 ofessionally perform and communicate in stressful and high impacting situat
 ions\n  *   CompTIA's A+ and Network+ certification preferred\; MCSE: Deskt
 op Infrastructure and CCNA a plus\n  *   Good oral and written communicatio
 n skills\n  *   Ability to work collaboratively with other IT Regional Spec
 ialists and cross-functional technical team members to support deadlines\; 
 ability to work independently as well\n  *   Ability to interface with exec
 utive level internal employees and troubleshoot their compute requirements\
 n  *   Strong aptitude for learning new technologies and understanding how 
 to utilize them in a customer-facing environment\n  *   Ability to follow s
 tandard engineering principles and practices\n  *   Creative approach to pr
 oblem solving\n  *   Ability to handle multiple tasks concurrently with com
 peting deadlines\n  *   Ability to travel to customer sites for installatio
 ns\, troubleshooting\, user training\, and relationship management\nCompens
 ation Details:\n$32.00/Hr. - $36.00/Hr. USD\nRequested Updates to Job Descr
 iption:\nThis is the client's ask:\n\nWe need a strong Desktop Support reso
 urce\, who can do executive support and has experience supporting Macs and 
 other Apple products\, but also experience on PCs and other End User device
 s. It is very important to set the right expectations that the role will no
 t be working on Macs or doing Executive Support all the time. 80% of our en
 vironment is Windows PCs\, so there is a lot of work in that area\, includi
 ng regular tickets\, break fixes\, pc refreshes\, etc. We are not looking f
 or an Apple/Jamf Engineer or Jamf. This role is Desktop Support\, not Deskt
 op Engineering.\n\n
