DESCRIPTION:<p><strong> Commute Time Calculation:</strong></p><ul><li><stro
 ng>Google Maps:</strong><ul><li>Use Google Maps to determine your commute t
 ime.</li><li>Enter your starting point (14 San Carlos Court\, Pittsburg\, C
 A) and your destination (300 Ellinwood Way\, Pleasant Hill\, CA).</li><li>G
 oogle Maps will provide you with both freeway and surface street commute ti
 mes.</li><li>For surface streets\, specifically input Bailey Road as a wayp
 oint to get the route you prefer.</li><li>Google maps can provide typical t
 raffic for the day and time you are searching.</li><li>Add this information
  into your google calendar event.</li></ul></li></ul><p><strong>3. Top News
  Stories:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Manual Website Checks:</strong><ul><l
 i>Visit ktvu.com\, kron4.com\, and abc7news.com each morning.</li><li>Ident
 ify the top three distinct stories from each site.</li><li>Summarize them b
 riefly.</li><li>Add this information into your google calendar event.</li><
 /ul></li></ul><p><strong>4. Ride-Share Discounts:</strong></p><ul><li><stro
 ng>Manual App Checks (Bi-Weekly):</strong><ul><li>Set a bi-weekly reminder 
 in your Google Calendar (or another reminder app).</li><li>On those days\, 
 open your Uber\, Lyft\, and Y-ride apps.</li><li>Check for any available di
 scounts in the 94565 area.</li><li>Add this information into your google ca
 lendar event.</li></ul></li></ul><p><strong>5-8. Daily Reminders:</strong><
 /p><ul><li><strong>Google Calendar or Reminder App:</strong><ul><li>Add ind
 ividual reminders to your Google Calendar or use a dedicated reminder app (
 like Google Keep\, Apple Reminders\, etc.).</li><li>Create reminders for:<u
 l><li>"Shave today"</li><li>"Pack your lunch"</li><li>"Pack your coffee"</l
 i><li>"Take medication"</li></ul></li><li>Set these reminders to trigger ar
 ound 6:15 AM or shortly after.</li></ul></li></ul><p><strong>9. Weather in 
 Pittsburg\, CA:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Google Search or Weather App:</
 strong><ul><li>A quick Google search for "weather Pittsburg CA" will provid
 e you with the current weather and forecast.</li><li>You can also use a wea
 ther app on your phone.</li><li>Add this information into your google calen
 dar event.</li></ul></li></ul><p><strong>10. Recurring Schedule:</strong></
 p><ul><li><strong>Google Calendar:</strong><ul><li>As mentioned in step 1\,
  your google calendar event can be set to reoccur daily M-F.</li></ul></li>
 </ul><p><strong>Example Google Calendar Event Description:</strong></p><ul>
 <li><strong>Commute Time:</strong><ul><li>Freeway: [Time]</li><li>Surface S
 treets (via Bailey Road): [Time]</li></ul></li><li><strong>News Summary:</s
 trong><ul><li>ktvu.com: [Story 1]\, [Story 2]\, [Story 3]</li><li>kron4.com
 : [Story 1]\, [Story 2]\, [Story 3]</li><li>abc7news.com: [Story 1]\, [Stor
 y 2]\, [Story 3]</li></ul></li><li><strong>Ride-Share Discounts:</strong><u
 l><li>(Check Bi-Weekly)</li></ul></li><li><strong>Reminders:</strong><ul><l
 i>Shave today</li><li>Pack your lunch</li><li>Pack your coffee</li><li>Take
  medication</li></ul></li><li><strong>Weather:</strong><ul><li>[Pittsburg\,
  CA weather forecast]</li></ul></li></ul>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250321T230353Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Daily Morning Routine
TRANSP:OPAQUE
